cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use STRATIM in your research, please cite this protocol."
title: "STRATIM: A Dynamic State-Space Model of Strategic Imagination Capacity under Chronic Material Pressure"
abstract: >-
  STRATIM is a dynamic state-space model for examining Strategic Imagination
  Capacity (SIC) under chronic material pressure. It separates objectively
  audited opportunity structure, perceived opportunity, SIC, rehearsal,
  recovery, and observable execution as analytically distinct variables,
  and specifies a longitudinal, multi-source observational design with
  pre-registered decision rules. At the current stage, STRATIM is a
  protocol (v0.1.0-protocol) with no empirical data.
